TIMING-6#1 Critical Warning
No common primary clock between related clocks  
The clocks cam_pclk_pin and clk_pll_i are related (timed together) but they have no common primary clock. The design could fail in hardware. To find a timing path between these clocks, run the following command: report_timing -from [get_clocks cam_pclk_pin] -to [get_clocks clk_pll_i]
